## Third-Party Components

This software is inspired by Redis's RDB format and background save mechanisms,
but contains no Redis source code. Any implementation references are based on
publicly available documentation and specifications.

### Dependencies (if applicable):
- LZF compression library (BSD-2-Clause) - Optional
- CRC64 implementation (Public Domain or compatible)

